From 03cd8530099a172f17f2773845c866644fefebd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 18:18:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 176/190] feat: SVOTI traces real triangles again, through a
 per-cell static BVH

Stage 1A of the rt topic (GPU side). The per-voxel triangle-list path CE
shipped (RayTraceMesh + geomPool_TInd + brickPool_RTri) is retired and
replaced by a stack-based BVH walk rooted per 32 m SVO cell.

New Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi:
- SBestHit / SRTInfo and the file-scope `static SRTInfo g_rtInfo`, so no
  existing CE tracing function changes its signature.
- Record addressing driven entirely by SVO_RTPoolInfo (W, D, A, Zt): no
  hard-coded 256 / 512 and no >>8 / >>16 shifts, which silently corrupt any
  pool that is not exactly 256 wide.
- Packing helpers: PackU16x2/UnpackU16x2, ExtractPosXY, ExtractDir,
  ExtractTC16 (16-bit UV fields instead of Neo's 12-bit), PackTC16,
  ExtractUint2, PackRGB/UnpackRGB.
- RT_RayTriangleIntersect: Moeller-Trumbore with a determinant epsilon
  relative to the edge lengths instead of a scale-dependent absolute one.
- RT_TraverseTris: 20-slot stack; the near child is pushed last so it pops
  first (child0 holds the lower half along the split axis); a stack overflow
  sets best.incomplete and KEEPS the hit instead of deleting it.
- RT_ProcessBestHit: material atlas at t28, atlas slice arithmetic from
  SVO_RTPoolInfo, emittance scaled by the shared MAT_EMISSIVE_UNIT_SCALE so
  a reflected emissive surface matches the surface itself.
- RT_SampleVoxelIrradiance and RT_GetDebugColor for the stage-1 provisional
  colour and the five debug views.
- The sprite branch is kept but unreachable until particles in stage 4.

CommonSVO.cfi:
- geomPool_TTex moves from t18 to t28 (t18 becomes Fwd_TiledLightsShadeInfo
  when the forward stack arrives in stage 2); geomPool_TInd and
  brickPool_RTri declarations go with RayTraceMesh.
- ConeTraceTree gains, under %_RT_SAMPLE6, a static-BVH branch that replaces
  the ConeTraceBrick call for cells at VOX_MAX_NODE_SIZE holding a root, and
  descends to that size regardless of LOD distance for triangle rays only.
- Under %_RT_QUALITY: the cell walk no longer stops at the first hit, it
  stops when the next cell can no longer beat the nearest hit; the dynamic
  and particle roots are traversed afterwards sharing the same SBestHit.

Total_Illumination.cfx ConeTracePS:
- triangle rays get VOX_MAX_RT_DIST_RAY as their length budget;
- a triangle hit is shaded provisionally as hitAlbedo * voxelRadiance /
  voxelAlbedo until the ShadePass of stage 2 exists;
- an incomplete traversal falls back to the voxel cone result;
- %_RT_PARTICLE_SHADOW selects the debug views.

Every changed hunk in the two existing shader files is inside
%_RT_QUALITY / %_RT_SAMPLE6 / %_RT_PARTICLE_SHADOW, or is the retirement of
RayTraceMesh and its now unreferenced resource declarations.

